Cell["Process tabular data", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"74e7b6e8-0439-46d3-8fb5-ca078b2a5326"],

Cell["\<\
Process tabular data via the specified circuit.
Format the data and the corresponding output as a table.
Supports multipe input and multiple output dimensions.

Optional: For predictive networks,  shift the output (predictions) to align \
with the input.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86cc569a-be37-4aff-8a57-73ac76739a7f"],

